# TODO: vim uses libvterm, author of libvterm also made pangoterm with it.
# is vim terminal closer to pangoterm than xterm?
vim|Vim terminal,
	use=xterm,
vim-256color|Vim terminal with 256 colors,
	use=xterm-256color,
zutty|Zutty,
	use=xterm,
zutty-256color|Zutty with 256 colors,
	use=xterm-256color,
